<title>USA: Micro Linear plans new repurchase program.</title>
<headline>Micro Linear plans new repurchase program.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micro Linear Corp said it plans to begin a stock repurchase program for $2.5 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>The shares may be purchased from time to time, depending upon market conditions, share price and other factors.</p>
<p>Over the past 18 months the company has repurchased 1.1 million shares of its common stock at an approximate cost of $10.8 million.</p>
<p>As of July 25, it had approximately 11.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
